If you want to use a Menelli box with a PC, all you need is:

        cphpg.s19  -- my version of glove code for HC11
        dlm.exe    -- downloader program for PC, to write the .s19 file
                      to the HC11's EEPROM
        dl.bat     -- Batch file used to download s/w to HC11
        menelli.gif - Circuit diagram

If you think you might want to modify the HC11 code, get the 
source (cphpg.asm) and the assembler (ass11.exe).

A version of REND386 which works with the Menelli box is 
available at http://www.cms.dmu.ac.uk/~cph/Public/Rend386/pgdemo.exe.


